Package: contextd
Version: 0.10.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Shane Fagan <shane@performativenonsense.com>
Depends: systemd, systemd-container
Description: Lightweight game and hardware context daemon (Portable Hybrid)
 A generic, lightweight Linux daemon that exposes process context and
 hardware inventory. Packaged as a systemd portable service, with an
 optional OpenRGB SDK bridge.
